sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports ISO 15118-20
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: Authorized
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: EVConnectedPreSession
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: ISO15118SmartCharging (iso15118-20)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger SetChargingProfile<br>evseId = Configured evseId<br>chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile<br>transactionId = Provided transactionId from before

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (evseId = Configured evseId, chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile, transactionId = Provided transactionId from before)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be Configured evseId<br>chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>transactionId must be Provided transactionId from before

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = Configured evseId, chargingSchedule = ChargingSchedule provided at step 1)

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
